91
08:12.121 --> 08:14.291
Do not take life too seriously.

92
08:15.391 --> 08:17.431
No one makes it out alive anyway.

93
08:21.201 --> 08:23.771
It hit me like a bolt of lightning.

94
08:24.971 --> 08:28.671
Right. Life is something no one makes it out of alive anyway,

95
08:29.041 --> 08:32.171
so why was I taking it so seriously and strictly?

96
08:32.371 --> 08:34.081
Why was I caring so much about what others think...

97
08:34.141 --> 08:36.511
and pretending to be so perfectly good all my life?

98
08:38.411 --> 08:41.781
So, it is a little late, but starting now,

99
08:42.151 --> 08:44.451
I am going to stop being fake and hypocritical.

100
08:45.421 --> 08:47.121
I will do whatever I want,

101
08:47.221 --> 08:50.061
