175
12:43.884 --> 12:45.614
I told you I am not getting a divorce.

176
12:47.814 --> 12:51.684
Right, Gyu Young. Let us never get a divorce. Okay?

177
12:52.584 --> 12:55.124
Sure. Let us not get a divorce,

178
