274
20:08.924 --> 20:12.294
Exactly. Hand over Han Gyu Oh.

275
20:12.364 --> 20:13.664
Han Gyu Oh is mine.

276
20:17.334 --> 20:19.964
If you get on my nerves one more time,

277
20:20.604 --> 20:22.734
