280
20:28.014 --> 20:29.274
Han Gyu Oh's brother equals...

281
20:29.344 --> 20:31.784
- my brother-in-law. - You even met Han Gyu Oh's brother?

282
20:31.914 --> 20:33.214
Yes, I met him.

283
20:33.814 --> 20:34.984
