294
21:28.174 --> 21:29.334
He says it's an exaggeration.

295
21:33.744 --> 21:35.574
Hee Na actually dumped Gyu Oh first.

296
21:36.074 --> 21:39.514
She stood him up and rejected him, so he dated me,

297
21:40.014 --> 21:42.354
