303
21:58.404 --> 21:59.864
About...

304
21:59.934 --> 22:01.074
one hundred times richer than Hee Na's?

305
22:01.134 --> 22:03.974
No, probably 1,000 times richer.

306
22:04.174 --> 22:08.314
I have three cars of my own, a vacation home in Jeju,

307
22:08.514 --> 22:11.444
and a massive apartment in Gangnam under my own name.

308
22:12.114 --> 22:14.254
Once my mother passes away and I inherit everything,

309
22:14.314 --> 22:16.714
Han Gyu Oh will never have to work a day in his life.

310
22:17.754 --> 22:18.984
You too, Gyu Seo.

311
22:20.454 --> 22:23.454
If you want, I can even send you to study abroad.

312
22:23.754 --> 22:25.794
Hey, is that your money?

313
22:25.864 --> 22:28.334
- That is your mother's money. - As for Kwon Hee Na,

314
22:28.594 --> 22:32.164
she lives in a studio apartment and has 100,000 dollars in debt.

315
22:32.904 --> 22:34.404
Her father's business went under, too,

316
22:34.474 --> 22:37.144
so her whole family lives in a tiny leased apartment.

317
22:37.504 --> 22:38.674
And in the countryside, at that.

318
22:41.614 --> 22:43.214
You little brat, seriously.

319
22:47.414 --> 22:48.584
Gyu Seo...

320
22:50.114 --> 22:55.024
Han Gyu Oh is dating me, not my family background.

321
22:58.424 --> 22:59.424
Keep going.

322
23:01.094 --> 23:03.264
Her older brother got fired and is unemployed.

323
23:03.694 --> 23:05.004
So even if she gets married,

324
23:05.064 --> 23:07.504
she has to pay off all her father's debt herself.

325
23:07.734 --> 23:09.104
If Han Gyu Oh marries Kwon Hee Na,

326
23:09.204 --> 23:10.644
he will spend his whole life paying off debt...

327
23:10.704 --> 23:11.704
until he grows old and dies.

328
23:14.974 --> 23:16.544
You are playing so dirty.

329
23:18.084 --> 23:20.014
You shallow, wicked girl.

330
23:29.954 --> 23:30.964
But...

331
23:31.564 --> 23:33.224
why would someone as incredible and amazing as you...

332
23:33.294 --> 23:34.864
want to date my brother?

333
23:35.694 --> 23:38.864
My brother is a high school dropout, does not have a decent job,

334
23:38.934 --> 23:40.264
and has no savings.

335
23:42.504 --> 23:43.774
Is it because he is handsome?

336
23:44.304 --> 23:45.644
Are you just going to live off his looks?

337
23:47.374 --> 23:50.684
Well, yes. I am going to live off his looks.

338
23:50.744 --> 23:52.814
- Why? - What if he gets old...

339
23:52.944 --> 23:53.984
and ugly?

340
23:57.354 --> 24:00.024
Well... If he gets ugly...

341
24:00.084 --> 24:02.794
Then you would just throw him away. Actually, no.

342
24:03.124 --> 24:04.764
Even before he gets old and sick,

343
24:05.094 --> 24:06.794
you would dump him the second you get bored, right?

344
24:07.124 --> 24:09.394
Just like you threw your friend away, cruelly and ruthlessly.

345
24:10.394 --> 24:12.064
Look here, Han Gyu Seo.

346
24:13.264 --> 24:14.734
My brother does not care about anything else either.

347
24:14.804 --> 24:16.034
He only looks at faces.

348
24:16.234 --> 24:18.004
He does not care if someone is rich or poor...

349
24:18.074 --> 24:20.174
he is just going to live off their looks, too.

350
24:20.404 --> 24:21.414
But...

351
24:21.814 --> 24:23.574
the prettiest person my brother has ever seen...

352
24:23.644 --> 24:24.944
is Ms. Kwon.

353
24:25.744 --> 24:26.884
My brother has bad eyesight,

354
24:26.944 --> 24:28.984
so he will not even notice when she gets old and ugly.

355
24:29.854 --> 24:30.924
He said he will never get LASIK...

356
24:30.984 --> 24:32.354
or wear glasses until the day he dies.

357
24:33.284 --> 24:34.654
My brother is totally weird, right?

358
24:40.024 --> 24:41.094
Unbelievable.

359
24:50.944 --> 24:51.944
Ms. Kwon.

360
24:56.014 --> 24:57.584
I will catch a taxi for you.

361
24:58.914 --> 25:00.984
Please tell me your address, Sister-in-law.

362
25:05.054 --> 25:06.324
Just now...

363
25:07.254 --> 25:08.594
What did you say?

364
25:09.524 --> 25:10.524
Your address.

365
25:11.164 --> 25:14.334
I asked you to tell me your address. Sister-in-law.

366
25:21.604 --> 25:22.674
Hurry up.

367
25:36.654 --> 25:37.654
Gyu Rim.

368
25:41.054 --> 25:42.054
Han Gyu Rim.

369
25:43.524 --> 25:44.624
Gyu Rim.

370
25:53.604 --> 25:54.704
Did I fall asleep?

371
25:55.804 --> 25:59.174
Yes. For about 20 minutes. You must have been very tired.

372
26:00.914 --> 26:02.414
By any chance...

373
26:02.814 --> 26:04.284
did I snore?

374
26:06.044 --> 26:07.114
Just...

375
26:07.184 --> 26:08.184
a little bit.

376
26:10.214 --> 26:13.154
Well, Gyeol said that I snore in my sleep,

377
26:13.224 --> 26:15.954
sleep with my mouth open, drool,

378
26:16.024 --> 26:18.864
- and even grind my teeth. - Well...

379
26:20.294 --> 26:21.964
That can happen if you are under a lot of stress.

380
26:22.034 --> 26:23.034
No.

381
26:23.264 --> 26:25.304
He said it is so bad that the person next to me cannot even sleep.

382
26:25.364 --> 26:29.004
I even scream in my sleep. One day, I woke up...

383
26:29.074 --> 26:30.404
and I was lying face down on the bathroom floor...

384
26:30.474 --> 26:31.774
sleeping like this.

385
26:34.174 --> 26:35.714
Do I have sleepwalking issues too?

386
26:37.174 --> 26:39.584
If you are worried, do you want to go see a doctor?

387
26:39.714 --> 26:40.714
What?

388
26:41.214 --> 26:42.214
No.

389
26:42.284 --> 26:43.914
Maybe if it gets a little more serious.

390
26:47.084 --> 26:49.324
I am a little worried, but...

391
26:50.194 --> 26:51.864
in the past,

392
26:52.564 --> 26:54.894
like Sleeping Beauty,

393
26:55.434 --> 26:58.034
you really did not make a single sound and slept so well.

394
26:59.904 --> 27:01.634
Unbelievable.

395
27:03.104 --> 27:04.344
This is ridiculous.

396
27:04.644 --> 27:05.644
Why?

397
27:05.704 --> 27:07.144
I mean, Sleeping Beauty,

398
27:07.204 --> 27:08.874
have you seen her sleeping? In person?

399
27:08.944 --> 27:11.284
If you are going to be like this, do not date me...

400
27:11.344 --> 27:13.314
and go date that Sleeping Beauty instead.

401
27:15.654 --> 27:17.014
This is a bit annoying.

402
27:18.224 --> 27:20.654
- It is truly ridiculous. - You...

403
27:20.754 --> 27:22.624
You looked like a princess today too.

404
27:22.694 --> 27:24.624
This is such a turnoff.

405
27:25.394 --> 27:28.034
It makes me even more angry. Things like that.

406
27:39.774 --> 27:41.814
Can wine taste this different?

407
27:42.314 --> 27:45.714
Man, I am in big trouble. My taste buds are completely ruined.

408
27:46.814 --> 27:48.854
Before I drank the wine Son-in-law Kim gave me,

409
27:48.914 --> 27:51.524
this 15-dollar wine tasted just fine,

410
27:51.584 --> 27:53.054
and I could not get enough of it.

411
27:53.754 --> 27:56.694
Man, this is a big problem. What am I going to do?

412
28:00.294 --> 28:01.634
Who are you?

413
28:02.194 --> 28:04.034
Who are you to drink someone else's wine...

414
28:04.764 --> 28:05.764
Excuse me...

415
28:07.934 --> 28:08.934
Gyu Rim?

416
28:21.414 --> 28:22.414
What was that?

417
28:40.564 --> 28:42.034
This is so embarrassing.

418
28:42.934 --> 28:44.344
I am so ashamed, really.

419
28:52.144 --> 28:54.554
I mean, I did everything you told me to do,

420
28:55.414 --> 28:56.554
is this right?

421
28:56.954 --> 28:59.524
Are you sure doing this will make him sick of me...

422
28:59.584 --> 29:01.094
and lose interest? Really?

423
29:18.644 --> 29:20.274
What is wrong with Han Gyu Rim?

424
29:22.614 --> 29:24.484
Did she get shot in the head or something?

425
29:25.544 --> 29:29.454
Watch your mouth. She might become your sister-in-law.

426
29:29.514 --> 29:30.514
Are you...

427
29:32.354 --> 29:33.584
Even after seeing her like that today,

428
29:33.684 --> 29:34.694
does it not bother you?

429
29:35.094 --> 29:36.594
If it were me, I would be so turned off...

430
29:37.254 --> 29:38.924
that I would not even want to look at her picture.

431
29:39.324 --> 29:40.764
I thought she just looked cute and pretty.

432
29:41.364 --> 29:42.894
Get a grip, you idiot.

433
29:42.994 --> 29:44.934
Gyu Rim did not just embarrass herself today,

434
29:45.004 --> 29:47.204
she completely humiliated you too.

435
29:47.504 --> 29:49.034
Announcing to everyone that she is your girlfriend...

436
29:49.104 --> 29:51.474
so openly and loudly, she did it on purpose.

437
29:51.774 --> 29:52.774
Man...

438
29:52.844 --> 29:54.574
I really did not expect that from Gyu Rim.

439
29:57.374 --> 29:58.384
Right.

440
29:59.584 --> 30:00.684
On purpose.

441
30:02.214 --> 30:04.924
- Gyu Rim did it on purpose. - That is what I am saying.

442
30:04.984 --> 30:06.724
She definitely did it on purpose.

443
30:07.324 --> 30:10.494
- Did she? Did Gyu Rim? - I just told you.

444
30:10.554 --> 30:11.594
She humiliated you.

445
30:11.664 --> 30:13.094
And why would she want to humiliate me?

446
30:13.164 --> 30:14.394
She humiliated you to...

447
30:15.894 --> 30:16.894
Wait, why would she?

448
30:18.064 --> 30:20.464
Right. That is enough.

449
30:22.034 --> 30:24.274
My mind was a bit of a mess today,

450
30:26.004 --> 30:29.144
but you helped me realise something. Thanks, buddy.

451
30:29.214 --> 30:30.944
I will buy you a drink soon, okay?

452
30:32.484 --> 30:33.944
You are actually helpful sometimes.

453
30:35.654 --> 30:36.754
On purpose.

454
30:38.054 --> 30:40.154
Right, she did it on purpose.

455
30:44.424 --> 30:46.624
Realize what? What did you realise?

456
30:47.464 --> 30:48.894
What did I even say to him?

457
31:27.204 --> 31:29.604
SOS. Gyu Young,

458
31:29.674 --> 31:32.544
I think Gyu Rim caught a deadly disease.

459
31:34.004 --> 31:35.314
What is he talking about?

460
31:35.744 --> 31:36.944
(Ongyeol Real Estate)

461
31:37.014 --> 31:39.184
(Suragan Side Dishes)

462
31:39.384 --> 31:40.384
Yes.

463
31:40.784 --> 31:42.884
- Gyu Young. - What are you talking about?

464
31:42.954 --> 31:44.214
If you are going to lie, make it believable.

465
31:44.284 --> 31:47.694
No, hey, Gyu Rim is acting strange. Very strange.

466
31:47.954 --> 31:49.824
She was dressed like a hunter,

467
31:50.194 --> 31:52.924
in some tiger skin print, wearing hot pants...

468
31:53.164 --> 31:56.534
and a headband. And her makeup was so heavy,

469
31:56.794 --> 31:58.464
and she had all these dangling earrings.

470
31:58.704 --> 32:00.764
Hey, why would she do that?

471
32:01.504 --> 32:03.474
She has completely changed.

472
32:03.704 --> 32:06.504
They say if someone changes, they are going to die.

473
32:06.904 --> 32:09.774
- Han Gyu Rim? - Yes, Han Gyu Rim.

474
32:10.244 --> 32:12.614
I did not even recognise her at first.

475
32:14.384 --> 32:15.384
Have you been drinking?

476
32:16.384 --> 32:17.384
Just a little wine.

477
32:17.724 --> 32:19.884
No, I am not saying this because I am drunk.

478
32:21.494 --> 32:23.154
Just wash your feet and go to sleep.

479
32:23.224 --> 32:24.664
If you startle me with something like this again,

480
32:24.724 --> 32:26.024
I am going to block your number,

481
32:26.224 --> 32:28.564
- so keep that in mind. - Hey, are you treating me...

482
32:28.694 --> 32:29.734
like a drunk right now?

483
32:29.794 --> 32:32.404
You cannot even help your daughter who is married and working hard,

484
32:32.664 --> 32:36.134
so please stop bothering me. I am begging you, Han Seok Joong.

485
32:37.634 --> 32:38.644
Darn it.

486
32:45.014 --> 32:46.714
I called you...

487
32:46.784 --> 32:48.154
because I had no one else to talk to about this.

488
32:48.884 --> 32:51.884
What a cold-hearted girl. If I ever call you again,

489
32:51.954 --> 32:55.424
- I will be a son of a dog. - Whose fault is it now?

490
32:55.824 --> 32:56.824
You startled me.

491
32:58.424 --> 33:00.594
You have no right to blame your daughter.

492
33:01.164 --> 33:05.264
If you really want to blame someone, you should poke your own eyes out...

493
33:05.334 --> 33:07.264
for living your life like that.

494
33:08.334 --> 33:09.334
Well, if you are behind me,

495
33:09.404 --> 33:13.904
- you should tell me you are there. - The bomb inside Gyu Rim...

496
33:14.374 --> 33:17.114
- just exploded. - What?

497
33:17.174 --> 33:21.614
Even back in 1960, women like that all walked around...

498
33:21.684 --> 33:23.214
with flowers in their hair, you know?

499
33:24.254 --> 33:27.454
At least Gyeol's mom has not put a flower in her hair yet,

500
33:27.524 --> 33:28.724
so that is a relief.

501
33:29.124 --> 33:30.994
She might not have a flower in her hair,

502
33:31.054 --> 33:32.464
but she was wearing a tiger headband.

503
33:32.924 --> 33:35.794
I have a bit of a guess.

504
33:43.004 --> 33:45.944
What, does she think I am a puppy that will just follow her around?

505
33:52.744 --> 33:54.654
Gyu Rim's Mom came to the side dish shop?

506
33:55.214 --> 33:57.854
Well, I was not there myself.

507
33:58.324 --> 34:02.854
That woman is clearly her mother, but she pretended not to be...

508
34:02.994 --> 34:05.894
and just tossed a lunchbox and left.

509
34:05.894 --> 34:07.524
Why did she even come...

510
34:07.594 --> 34:08.664
if she was not going to acknowledge her?

511
34:09.034 --> 34:10.034
What is with the lunchbox?

512
34:10.594 --> 34:12.534
Did she think we could not even afford...

513
34:12.604 --> 34:14.464
- to eat a lunchbox? - That is what I am saying.

514
34:15.834 --> 34:17.804
Gyu Rim chased after her late,

515
34:18.444 --> 34:20.404
screaming at the top of her lungs.

516
34:21.044 --> 34:24.074
Mom!

517
34:25.714 --> 34:27.514
She called out to her so desperately,

518
34:28.084 --> 34:29.454
it was truly heartbreaking.

519
34:30.484 --> 34:32.084
If I at least knew that woman's phone number,

520
34:32.154 --> 34:34.224
I would have given her a piece of my mind.

521
34:34.284 --> 34:36.494
This woman, seriously!

522
34:38.524 --> 34:40.724
I have her phone number!

523
34:40.794 --> 34:42.834
- What? - When she came last time,

524
34:42.894 --> 34:43.894
she told me to contact her...

525
34:43.964 --> 34:45.034
if I changed my mind about moving there.

526
34:45.104 --> 34:46.104
Oh my.

527
34:46.664 --> 34:47.974
This woman, seriously, darn it.

528
34:48.604 --> 34:50.274
- Here you go. - Thank you.

529
34:50.334 --> 34:52.104
- Enjoy your meal. - Yes, we will.

530
34:52.174 --> 34:54.304
- Okay. - This looks really good.

531
34:55.674 --> 34:56.914
This is my first time seeing this too.

532
35:07.454 --> 35:09.124
I am busy. What is it?

533
35:09.454 --> 35:11.264
Even in her text messages,

534
35:11.324 --> 35:14.164
an icy Siberian wind is blowing.

535
35:14.894 --> 35:17.594
I need to hit her with a good comeback.

536
35:18.104 --> 35:19.104
What should I say?

537
35:19.804 --> 35:21.004
Because of you, Gyu Rim...

538
35:21.934 --> 35:24.374
lost her mind. Should I say that?

539
35:25.144 --> 35:27.744
She could have lost her mind...

540
35:27.944 --> 35:30.344
over one million times because of you, too.

541
35:30.474 --> 35:32.614
(Because of you, Gyu Rim lost her mind.)

542
35:34.684 --> 35:36.754
Why did you just drop off the lunchbox...

543
35:37.654 --> 35:38.684
and leave without telling Gyu Rim...

544
35:38.754 --> 35:41.124
- that you are her mom? - Mom!

545
35:41.294 --> 35:42.424
Mom!

546
35:43.224 --> 35:46.564
She cried, calling for you until her throat bled.

547
35:47.464 --> 35:48.464
Write that down, too.

548
35:51.634 --> 35:53.204
Why did you just drop off the lunchbox...

549
35:53.464 --> 35:55.604
and leave without telling Gyu Rim that you are her mom?

550
35:57.604 --> 35:59.504
Why did you even come if you were not going to say hello?

551
36:00.044 --> 36:01.044
What is with the lunchbox?

552
36:01.774 --> 36:03.514
Did you drop it off because you thought...

553
36:03.574 --> 36:04.644
we could not even afford to eat?

554
36:05.814 --> 36:08.184
Hey. After you left, Gyu Rim...

555
36:08.354 --> 36:12.124
cried her eyes out, calling for you until her throat bled.

556
36:14.154 --> 36:15.794
She has a lot of nerve.

557
36:17.924 --> 36:20.364
She does. She is completely shameless.

558
36:21.164 --> 36:23.634
She has no maternal instinct, no humanity.

559
36:24.294 --> 36:25.904
And respect for her husband?

560
36:26.004 --> 36:29.134
- She does not have an ounce of it. - I am talking about your face.

561
36:29.204 --> 36:30.504
Your face.

562
36:32.174 --> 36:36.874
I am not shameless, okay? My skin is so delicate.

563
36:37.144 --> 36:39.214
I get breakouts all the time.

564
36:39.984 --> 36:44.414
Who made Gyu Rim's mom turn out like that?

565
36:45.024 --> 36:47.484
- Who kicked his own wife out... - Who kicked his own wife out...

566
36:47.484 --> 36:49.354
- so she could not even be a mother. - so she could not even be a mother.

567
36:50.054 --> 36:51.324
- Gyeol's grandfather is... - Gyeol's grandfather is...

568
36:51.324 --> 36:52.594
- the root of all this, is he not? - the root of all this, is he not?

569
36:52.664 --> 36:55.964
- What are you doing right now. - I have heard it so many times,

570
36:56.034 --> 36:57.364
I have memorized exactly what you...

571
36:57.434 --> 37:00.164
are going to say next down to the very last word.

572
37:01.264 --> 37:03.904
Right. You are something else.

573
37:06.574 --> 37:07.574
But...

574
37:08.744 --> 37:10.844
are you really innocent, ma'am?

575
37:12.014 --> 37:13.014
What?

576
37:13.544 --> 37:14.884
You tormented and bullied...

577
37:14.954 --> 37:18.124
our Gyu Rim just because she dumped Heung Sik.

578
37:19.024 --> 37:21.084
How long ago was that?

579
37:21.924 --> 37:25.364
I made up with Gyeol's Mom a long time ago.

580
37:25.794 --> 37:28.594
We are very close now.

581
37:29.494 --> 37:33.864
That is just what you think. I think everyone had a hand...

582
37:33.934 --> 37:37.274
in making our Gyu Rim turn out so strange, yes.

583
37:38.644 --> 37:42.144
If you think you are innocent, then cast the first stone.

584
37:52.784 --> 37:53.784
Why are you hitting me?

585
37:54.384 --> 37:55.654
Even if I have sins,

586
37:55.994 --> 37:59.864
that smug head of yours needs a good smack. Get out.

587
37:59.924 --> 38:01.834
- Do you want another smack? - That is enough.

588
38:01.894 --> 38:03.164
- What is wrong with you? - Come here you...

589
38:03.164 --> 38:05.264
- Where are you running off to? - That is enough.

590
38:05.334 --> 38:06.334
I need to smack you some more.

591
38:25.724 --> 38:27.084
We agreed to take care of ourselves,

592
38:27.584 --> 38:29.754
so why are you doing everyone's laundry all by yourself?

593
38:30.624 --> 38:32.994
I know, right? I was wondering why there was so much laundry.

594
38:35.494 --> 38:36.494
Did you drink?

595
38:40.034 --> 38:41.434
I think I am a little drunk.

596
38:42.604 --> 38:43.774
I drank too fast.

597
38:44.304 --> 38:45.304
Because I was so embarrassed.

598
38:45.674 --> 38:46.804
What were you embarrassed about?

599
38:48.974 --> 38:49.974
Just a little something.

600
38:51.714 --> 38:54.344
Since when do you know how to do this, Gyu Seo?

601
38:54.514 --> 38:55.684
You used to do this for me.

602
38:57.784 --> 39:00.884
I think it is going down a bit, Doctor.

603
39:03.954 --> 39:05.624
I choked on something yesterday too,

604
39:06.294 --> 39:09.194
and some lady rubbed my back just like this.

605
39:10.634 --> 39:12.404
But it honestly felt exactly like you.

606
39:13.504 --> 39:14.534
Exactly like you.

607
39:16.634 --> 39:17.634
What lady?

608
39:19.174 --> 39:21.444
Just someone. Just a lady I know.

609
39:24.114 --> 39:25.114
Gyu Seo.

610
39:26.814 --> 39:28.684
What kind of woman do you think...

611
39:28.854 --> 39:30.354
is the most awful woman in the world?

612
39:31.054 --> 39:32.754
The kind of woman you are scared to even dream about.

613
39:33.824 --> 39:36.024
Can you give me a specific example?

614
39:42.664 --> 39:44.734
I am sorry for getting mad earlier.

615
39:45.104 --> 39:46.264
(I am sorry for getting mad earlier.)

616
39:47.504 --> 39:49.104
It is okay, I understand.

617
40:02.614 --> 40:04.854
I am sending you a video as an apology.

618
40:05.484 --> 40:06.554
Watch it when you are alone.

619
40:07.054 --> 40:08.754
- Sweet dreams. - What is this?

620
40:10.924 --> 40:12.064
Is anyone there?

621
40:12.664 --> 40:14.094
Please help me.

622
40:33.044 --> 40:36.614
- Hello. - Jung Woo, where are you right now?

623
40:36.814 --> 40:38.724
Hey, come over here quickly. Come right now.

624
40:38.784 --> 40:41.454
- Come right this second. Hurry. - What is wrong with him?

625
40:41.524 --> 40:42.724
Hey, if the elevator does not come down,

626
40:42.794 --> 40:44.494
just take the stairs, hurry.

627
40:44.654 --> 40:46.394
What is it? Did you see a ghost or something?

628
40:46.464 --> 40:49.934
Yes, I just saw a ghost. Darn it. Hey, what do I do? I am so scared.

629
40:49.994 --> 40:52.334
Do not hang up.

630
40:52.434 --> 40:54.434
(456 Geumje-dong 4ga)

631
40:57.374 --> 41:00.904
Gyu Rim, Mu Jin is here. He brought bread, soup, and salad...

632
41:00.974 --> 41:02.314
and made a whole bunch of food...

633
41:04.274 --> 41:06.744
to make us breakfast. Hurry up and come.

634
41:12.124 --> 41:15.324
Wow, did you make all of this yourself?

635
41:15.594 --> 41:17.994
- You even baked the bread? - Yes.

636
41:18.094 --> 41:20.294
Our house feels just like a restaurant.

637
41:21.524 --> 41:22.534
Eat up, Gyeol.

638
41:22.934 --> 41:24.934
You need to eat a lot of salad especially, okay?

639
41:25.004 --> 41:26.004
Okay.

640
41:26.134 --> 41:27.964
Did you prepare the plates, forks, knives, and spoons...

641
41:28.234 --> 41:30.274
- all by yourself? - Yes.

642
41:30.334 --> 41:31.604
I also brewed some coffee.

643
41:32.004 --> 41:33.004
I will go get it.

644
41:35.214 --> 41:37.044
This looks so delicious.

645
41:38.384 --> 41:39.484
Mu Jin, you are here?

646
41:39.984 --> 41:40.984
Yes.

647
41:45.654 --> 41:46.924
This looks really delicious.

648
41:47.424 --> 41:48.424
Thank you, Mu Jin.

649
41:51.054 --> 41:53.424
Actually, I had a favour to ask of you.

650
41:53.764 --> 41:54.764
What is it?

651
41:56.094 --> 41:59.864
Our refrigerator is really old, so it keeps breaking down.

652
42:00.234 --> 42:02.374
The freezer just broke down a little while ago.

653
42:03.774 --> 42:05.604
Could you buy us a new refrigerator?

654
42:06.874 --> 42:07.874
A refrigerator?

655
42:08.344 --> 42:09.774
We can just call a repairman.

656
42:10.444 --> 42:12.514
I will fix it. I can just fix it.

657
42:13.084 --> 42:16.414
We should buy our own refrigerator. Why are you asking Mu Jin to buy it?

658
42:17.014 --> 42:19.384
Well, he could buy it for us.

659
42:19.784 --> 42:22.224
Our Son-in-law Kim is richer than you think.

660
42:22.324 --> 42:23.494
- Dad. - Father.

661
42:24.124 --> 42:26.924
Hey, it is not like I asked him to buy it.

662
42:27.294 --> 42:28.894
Gyu Rim is the one who asked.

663
42:29.864 --> 42:31.904
Did I put too much pressure on you?

664
42:32.134 --> 42:33.134
No.

665
42:33.304 --> 42:34.734
Actually, when I replace my refrigerator,

666
42:34.804 --> 42:36.434
I was thinking it would be nice to replace yours too.

667
42:36.504 --> 42:37.504
That is what I was thinking.

668
42:39.104 --> 42:42.874
How is our Son-in-law Kim so thoughtful?

669
42:42.874 --> 42:44.114
That is not right, Father.

670
42:44.174 --> 42:45.184
That is really not right.

671
42:45.284 --> 42:46.644
They are saying that is not right, Dad.

672
42:46.714 --> 42:50.614
- What is wrong is wrong, Grandpa. - Look at this.

673
42:50.714 --> 42:52.484
You are all ganging up on me again.

674
42:52.624 --> 42:54.454
Hey, Gyu Rim is the one who asked for the refrigerator.

675
42:54.524 --> 42:56.954
I did not even bring up the word refrigerator.

676
42:57.654 --> 43:02.294
But a little while ago, I saw an electronics commercial,

677
43:03.034 --> 43:05.104
and it said if you replace the refrigerator, washing machine,

678
43:05.164 --> 43:07.464
and TV all at once,

679
43:07.534 --> 43:10.034
- they give you a huge discount. - Really?

680
43:10.204 --> 43:11.274
Since we are replacing it,

681
43:11.374 --> 43:14.304
do you want to bundle the washer and TV and replace them all?

682
43:14.604 --> 43:15.974
- Father. - Grandfather.

683
43:16.974 --> 43:18.214
Hey, you guys seriously.

684
43:18.274 --> 43:20.784
This time, I was actually trying to stop Gyu Rim, okay?

685
43:20.984 --> 43:24.154
What is wrong with you seriously? Did you leave money with Mu Jin?

686
43:24.214 --> 43:27.124
Are we beggars? Hey, what if Mu Jin gets fed up...

687
43:27.184 --> 43:28.994
and runs away?

688
43:29.424 --> 43:32.364
Why is she acting so unreasonable today?

689
43:33.194 --> 43:34.824
Mu Jin will not run away.

690
43:35.234 --> 43:37.234
He said he would give me the stars and the moon in the sky,

691
43:37.294 --> 43:38.504
why would he run away over something small?

692
43:39.764 --> 43:42.634
If you guys want anything, just say it. Okay?

693
43:42.704 --> 43:45.204
Mu Jin is actually really rich.

694
43:45.444 --> 43:48.544
So do not feel pressured, do not worry about saving face,

695
43:48.674 --> 43:51.144
and tell him everything you want. Everything.

696
43:55.614 --> 43:56.614
Even so...

697
44:03.054 --> 44:04.194
What is wrong with Gyu Rim?

698
44:04.554 --> 44:05.994
She suddenly seems like a different person.

699
44:06.594 --> 44:07.794
Maybe she was joking?

700
44:08.194 --> 44:10.634
I saw it with my own eyes, but I still cannot believe it.

701
44:15.474 --> 44:16.834
(Post)

702
44:17.504 --> 44:19.874
- Oh, my. - What is it? What is wrong?

703
44:21.544 --> 44:23.144
These are a video and comments...

704
44:23.214 --> 44:24.674
from our restaurant message board yesterday.

705
44:26.114 --> 44:28.184
What is with her fashion from head to toe?

706
44:28.654 --> 44:30.054
Does she have a grudge against tigers?

707
44:31.614 --> 44:33.624
Putting her shoes on the table is such terrible manners.

708
44:33.684 --> 44:34.984
I thought it was a hidden camera prank.

709
44:35.354 --> 44:37.554
Should a terrible customer like that not be kicked out immediately?

710
44:37.754 --> 44:39.364
We are talking about Gyu Rim right now.

711
44:39.894 --> 44:41.694
Look at your restaurant social media later.

712
44:41.794 --> 44:45.164
But is it true she is Chef Kim Mu Jin's girlfriend?

713
44:46.464 --> 44:48.134
They say she is the owner chef's girlfriend,

714
44:48.204 --> 44:49.234
she does not know what Vongole is...

715
44:49.304 --> 44:52.444
- It is completely ridiculous. - Hey, is that about Gyu Rim?

716
44:52.804 --> 44:53.804
Give it to me.

717
44:55.814 --> 44:57.944
(Terrible Customer)

718
44:58.984 --> 45:01.144
No way this is Gyu Rim.

719
45:01.214 --> 45:03.284
Look closely. It is Gyu Rim.

720
45:08.924 --> 45:10.194
It is Gyu Rim, right? Gyu Oh.

721
45:10.454 --> 45:12.124
She was fine until yesterday evening.

722
45:12.424 --> 45:13.964
Why is Gyu Rim suddenly acting like this?

723
45:14.024 --> 45:16.464
Last time, she said she lost something.

724
45:16.694 --> 45:20.064
But she did not know what she lost. Is it like that time?

725
45:20.204 --> 45:22.334
Did she hurt her head or something? Is it some kind of aftereffect?

726
45:27.444 --> 45:28.444
Were you guys...

727
45:29.844 --> 45:31.174
talking about Gyu Rim too?

728
45:32.314 --> 45:33.314
Right?

729
45:34.584 --> 45:37.614
Hey, when I came back inside from going out yesterday,

730
45:38.154 --> 45:41.384
with her clothes, makeup, and hair, I thought some strange woman...

731
45:41.454 --> 45:44.254
was picking the lock to come in. Hey.

732
45:44.954 --> 45:48.634
Does she not remind you of anyone?

733
45:48.994 --> 45:50.634
She definitely looks like Gyu Rim on the outside,

734
45:50.794 --> 45:52.964
but her rude way of talking is exactly like someone else.

735
45:54.764 --> 45:57.534
Honestly, for a second, I thought she was Han Gyu Young.

736
45:57.874 --> 45:58.874
Me too.

737
45:58.944 --> 46:02.774
Right? You guys think so too, right? I thought it was Gyu Young talking,

738
46:02.774 --> 46:04.574
not Gyu Rim.

739
46:04.874 --> 46:07.014
It is as if Gyu Young's spirit entered Gyu Rim...

740
46:07.084 --> 46:08.444
What are you trying to say?

741
46:08.914 --> 46:12.084
Hey. Should we hold an exorcism?

742
46:13.984 --> 46:16.754
It is just like the story in volume eight...

743
46:17.094 --> 46:19.194
of "I Am an Exorcist." It is exactly like this situation.

744
46:19.964 --> 46:21.464
That energy in Gyu Young's room...

745
46:21.524 --> 46:24.234
that was obsessed with money and scamming men...

746
46:24.394 --> 46:25.404
must have entered Gyu Rim...

747
46:25.464 --> 46:27.134
Hey, you brats, your father is talking.

748
46:29.674 --> 46:30.674
Darn it.

749
46:31.474 --> 46:32.474
Fine.

750
46:32.544 --> 46:35.644
What would I even talk about with high schoolers?

751
46:39.144 --> 46:40.144
Eldest son.

752
46:41.484 --> 46:43.084
What your father is saying...

753
46:43.184 --> 46:45.824
might sound like nonsense at first glance...

754
46:45.884 --> 46:48.084
Even if you do not just glance at it, it is nonsense.

755
46:49.594 --> 46:52.624
Stop reading those weird comic books and read Nietzsche instead.

756
46:53.024 --> 46:54.524
Ask Mu Jin to lend it to you.

757
46:56.234 --> 46:59.134
Nietzsche, my foot. You selfish brat.

758
46:59.764 --> 47:00.764
Hey.

759
47:02.674 --> 47:04.204
Fine!

760
47:04.504 --> 47:06.574
Sisters and brothers are all useless.

761
47:07.344 --> 47:10.514
I am the only one who truly worries about Gyu Rim.

762
47:17.214 --> 47:19.654
At this rate, is Gyu Rim going to get...

763
47:19.724 --> 47:21.284
dumped by Mu Jin?

764
47:22.194 --> 47:23.524
It is hard for a single mother with a child...

765
47:24.154 --> 47:26.464
to meet such a great catch.

766
47:40.304 --> 47:41.304
Mom.

767
47:41.774 --> 47:42.774
Yes?

768
47:43.574 --> 47:44.574
What is wrong with you?

769
47:46.444 --> 47:47.444
What do you mean?

770
47:47.884 --> 47:50.454
Do you really not know...

771
47:50.454 --> 47:54.154
that you are acting so weird today?

772
47:57.654 --> 47:58.664
I know.

773
47:59.564 --> 48:00.564
I know, but...

774
48:01.564 --> 48:02.664
let us just let it go.

775
48:03.594 --> 48:05.604
Then why are you doing it if you know it is weird?

776
48:06.204 --> 48:09.134
I asked him to buy me a refrigerator...

777
48:09.334 --> 48:11.004
and a washing machine too.

778
48:11.674 --> 48:15.574
I will tell you everything later about why I acted so weird,

779
48:16.244 --> 48:17.644
so let us just let it go for today.

780
48:21.744 --> 48:23.684
You would not understand even if I told you anyway.

781
48:24.584 --> 48:27.524
You will understand me later when you grow up.

782
48:28.794 --> 48:30.294
You should go to school. You are late.

783
48:30.954 --> 48:35.164
Is your goal to get rejected by Mu Jin?

784
48:37.764 --> 48:38.964
Is your goal to make Mu Jin...

785
48:39.864 --> 48:41.564
say he hates someone like you...

786
48:42.704 --> 48:44.404
and run far away?

787
48:45.674 --> 48:46.944
Is that your goal?

788
48:49.174 --> 48:50.174
Is it obvious?

789
48:51.474 --> 48:52.984
Of course it is obvious.

790
48:57.254 --> 48:58.354
It is not like I have known Gyu Rim...

791
48:58.414 --> 48:59.424
for 1 or 2 days,

792
48:59.524 --> 49:00.954
so it is completely obvious that she is trying...

793
49:01.384 --> 49:03.054
to push me away on purpose.

794
49:05.094 --> 49:06.524
Do I look like such a pushover?

795
49:07.564 --> 49:08.834
Did she think I would lose interest...

796
49:08.894 --> 49:10.564
and say we should stop seeing each other?

797
49:10.664 --> 49:12.034
Did she think I would run away?

798
49:14.434 --> 49:16.174
What does she take me for?

799
49:16.374 --> 49:18.844
So what is it that you want to say...

800
49:18.904 --> 49:20.904
after calling me out here and keeping me from eating?

801
49:21.874 --> 49:23.344
What is your point?

802
49:25.544 --> 49:26.584
The point is,

803
49:27.544 --> 49:28.544
well...

804
49:29.884 --> 49:34.024
I wanted to talk a little trash about my Gyu Rim,

805
49:34.824 --> 49:36.024
but I had no one to talk to.

806
49:36.554 --> 49:38.094
I could not tell Jung Woo...

807
49:38.154 --> 49:40.294
because he is the type of guy who would take it too seriously.

808
49:41.994 --> 49:44.294
I am someone who once...

809
49:44.994 --> 49:47.104
tried to date Gyu Rim, you know.

810
49:47.264 --> 49:48.264
You also came to me back then...

811
49:48.334 --> 49:49.334
and completely got on my nerves.

812
49:49.404 --> 49:51.174
You talked about a confession from Gyu Rim or whatever,

813
49:51.534 --> 49:53.444
and then when you got dumped,

814
49:53.574 --> 49:54.874
you asked how you were supposed to endure it...

815
49:54.944 --> 49:57.844
and begged for some great tips. What kind of great tips are there...

816
49:57.914 --> 49:59.284
for getting dumped?

817
49:59.714 --> 50:01.314
So are you getting revenge right now?

818
50:02.914 --> 50:04.114
It is not exactly revenge.

819
50:08.124 --> 50:10.724
It is just that Gyu Rim keeps going out of her way...

820
50:10.794 --> 50:12.054
to push me away like this,

821
50:12.224 --> 50:15.364
and when I think about it, it really upsets me.

822
50:15.834 --> 50:17.364
I keep feeling resentful toward Gyu Rim.

823
50:18.064 --> 50:19.064
So...

824
50:21.234 --> 50:23.134
Even so, why did I come to you?

825
50:24.234 --> 50:26.704
Right. Right.

826
50:27.974 --> 50:29.314
I must have been crazy for a second.

827
50:30.314 --> 50:31.344
I am sorry.

828
50:33.514 --> 50:35.954
If you have not had breakfast, should I buy you some?

829
50:36.014 --> 50:37.354
We could eat together...

830
50:38.354 --> 50:41.524
It is truly a shame to watch this alone.

831
50:41.824 --> 50:44.994
Looking so perfectly normal like a model student,

832
50:45.524 --> 50:46.764
who would have known you were this crazy?

833
50:46.824 --> 50:48.094
People probably do not know, right?

834
50:50.434 --> 50:51.864
Do not be like that, let us just eat.

835
50:51.934 --> 50:53.634
The bean sprout soup place here is pretty good.

836
50:55.834 --> 50:57.074
Well, I suppose,

837
50:57.904 --> 51:00.374
love turning a person into a crazy fool overnight,

838
51:00.444 --> 51:01.704
I have seen it a time or two.

839
51:05.274 --> 51:08.384
If Gyu Rim is trying that hard to push you away,

840
51:08.514 --> 51:11.484
there must be a good reason for her to do so,

841
51:12.384 --> 51:16.254
so brace yourself, and just give up on her.

842
51:18.294 --> 51:19.294
What?

843
51:20.194 --> 51:22.794
Give up? Back then, you said you were rooting...

844
51:22.894 --> 51:25.264
- for Gyu Rim and me. - I did root for you.

845
51:25.364 --> 51:27.364
I sincerely rooted for you.

846
51:29.074 --> 51:30.334
But that was before I knew...

847
51:30.334 --> 51:32.504
you were the only son of a conglomerate family.

848
51:35.174 --> 51:36.544
The youngest son of a conglomerate family,

849
51:36.744 --> 51:39.484
no, even if you were just the second son,

850
51:40.014 --> 51:41.544
I would have told you to push through no matter what,

851
51:41.614 --> 51:42.784
and I would have taken your side.

852
51:45.254 --> 51:48.054
I heard you cut ties with your mom because of Gyu Rim...

853
51:48.224 --> 51:50.854
and left all your wealth behind when you walked out.

854
51:51.424 --> 51:52.424
Yes.

855
51:53.964 --> 51:56.394
From Gyu Rim's perspective, imagine how burdensome that must be.

856
51:56.764 --> 51:59.704
Gyu Rim is not crazy about luxury goods like Gyu Young,

857
51:59.964 --> 52:02.134
nor is she someone who risks her life for money.

858
52:02.504 --> 52:05.304
With Gyu Rim's personality, making Kim Mu Jin an unfilial son...

859
52:05.434 --> 52:07.704
would feel like sitting on a bed of thorns.

860
52:07.974 --> 52:10.144
Why would she ever agree to a marriage like that?

861
52:10.714 --> 52:13.714
Then, is the only son of a conglomerate family...

862
52:13.984 --> 52:16.384
not allowed to marry the woman he loves?

863
52:17.414 --> 52:19.554
This is exactly what reverse discrimination is.

864
52:19.984 --> 52:23.324
And she is not marrying my mother, she is marrying me.

865
52:23.894 --> 52:26.224
The reason I gave up everything and left home...

866
52:26.824 --> 52:28.824
is because my mother only looks at backgrounds...

867
52:28.964 --> 52:31.164
instead of the person, and that is not right, okay?

868
52:34.734 --> 52:36.734
When I hear this, it sounds right,

869
52:37.204 --> 52:39.274
and when I hear that, that sounds right too.

870
52:40.774 --> 52:41.804
In that case,

871
52:42.574 --> 52:46.114
I am neutral. Neither a bird nor a mouse.

872
52:46.644 --> 52:47.744
Or maybe a bat.

873
52:49.514 --> 52:50.614
What?

874
52:52.384 --> 52:54.124
You are no help at all, darn it.

875
53:01.224 --> 53:02.994
What is this?

876
53:03.564 --> 53:05.034
How dare you do this to your husband's face.

877
53:15.974 --> 53:17.314
I am asking you nicely,

878
53:18.244 --> 53:19.984
so clean it up yourself.

879
53:20.514 --> 53:21.514
Right now.

880
53:23.314 --> 53:25.384
I am asking you nicely, so clean this up right now.

881
53:26.324 --> 53:28.854
Let me eat too. It is already past ten o'clock.

882
53:29.024 --> 53:30.224
Eating breakfast past ten o'clock...

883
53:30.354 --> 53:31.894
Is that something to be proud of?

884
53:32.794 --> 53:35.694
Mom, look at this. Gyu Young wrote on my face.

885
53:37.134 --> 53:39.434
What? Dog? Hey.

886
53:39.564 --> 53:42.064
If my son is a dog baby, does that make me a dog?

887
53:42.774 --> 53:45.174
Where did you learn such terrible manners?

888
53:45.534 --> 53:47.074
Hey, wipe this off right now.

889
53:51.714 --> 53:53.714
Seriously, what is wrong with her?

890
53:54.414 --> 53:57.284
How did her parents even raise her?

891
53:59.554 --> 54:02.554
Hey, this is your face, not mine!

892
54:02.724 --> 54:05.154
Stop looking at your phone and wipe this off, right now.

893
54:05.924 --> 54:07.294
These two, seriously.

894
54:08.924 --> 54:10.264
Why is it not coming off?

895
54:10.894 --> 54:14.804
Hey, Kang Sung Wook. Go find some nail polish remover.

896
54:15.204 --> 54:16.204
Hurry.

897
54:18.334 --> 54:20.544
On my handsome son's face...

898
54:23.574 --> 54:26.014
My son's face is all red...

899
54:26.084 --> 54:28.384
- Look at it smudging. - What is this now?

900
54:29.184 --> 54:31.054
It is a picture of my and Sung Wook's baby...

901
54:31.114 --> 54:33.854
They said it is eight weeks along. I sent it to the baby's father too.

902
54:34.054 --> 54:36.594
- Is our Sung Wook not so happy? - It is all smudged.

903
54:38.454 --> 54:42.094
She is bullying such a handsome son. A dog?

904
54:43.394 --> 54:45.294
So handsome.

905
54:51.604 --> 54:53.304
Are you crazy?

906
54:56.474 --> 54:57.744
That girl...

907
54:58.574 --> 55:00.314
is pregnant with Sung Wook's baby.

908
55:01.214 --> 55:02.714
She is eight weeks along.

909
55:04.414 --> 55:05.414
Kang Sung Wook.

910
55:07.624 --> 55:11.894
You are truly beyond saving. You scammer. You dirty bastard.

911
55:13.064 --> 55:14.224
You are the one who scammed us,

912
55:14.294 --> 55:16.794
- you scamming wench. - Hey.

913
55:17.964 --> 55:18.994
Mom.

914
55:25.474 --> 55:26.474
Hey.

915
55:27.604 --> 55:28.974
Did you think we would not find out?

916
55:30.174 --> 55:31.814
You have a perfectly fine father,

917
55:31.874 --> 55:33.784
but you conspired with a conglomerate Chairman...

918
55:33.984 --> 55:35.514
to trick us into thinking he was your father.

919
55:35.584 --> 55:36.914
Did you think we would not know?

920
55:54.764 --> 55:56.574
Yes, it is very good.

921
55:57.304 --> 55:58.304
The evaluation team...

922
55:58.404 --> 56:00.044
and the agencies are responding well, right?

923
56:00.144 --> 56:01.744
Yes. Great.

924
56:01.744 --> 56:03.174
Our hard work is paying off.

925
56:03.714 --> 56:05.274
- Thank you. - Good work.

926
56:05.674 --> 56:07.014
Yes, get back to work.

927
56:08.914 --> 56:09.914
Yes.

928
56:10.584 --> 56:13.154
A man named Kang Sang Man is currently in the lobby,

929
56:13.224 --> 56:15.254
and he contacted us saying he is here to see the Chairman.

930
56:16.824 --> 56:17.954
Kang Sang Man?

931
56:20.164 --> 56:21.824
Hold on, I've heard that name before.

932
56:23.294 --> 56:24.694
He said he's Han Gyu Young's father-in-law,

933
56:24.764 --> 56:26.064
so you would know him.

934
56:29.804 --> 56:31.204
Right, Kang Sang Man.

935
56:33.574 --> 56:35.044
Right, thank you. Yes.

936
56:36.274 --> 56:37.944
I haven't been able to contact you,

937
56:38.574 --> 56:39.814
so it's been a while.

938
56:40.244 --> 56:42.714
- Has everything been well, in-law? - Of course.

939
56:43.084 --> 56:45.354
I heard you're a man of great character...

940
56:45.884 --> 56:49.754
- and honesty in the business world. - You flatter me.

941
56:49.994 --> 56:51.554
For someone as upright as you,

942
56:51.794 --> 56:54.294
how much guilt must you have felt?

943
56:54.964 --> 56:57.494
You couldn't even stretch your legs and sleep comfortably, right?

944
56:59.094 --> 57:00.504
What are you talking about?

945
57:01.204 --> 57:05.074
Well, honestly, who in this world is without flaws?

946
57:06.104 --> 57:07.244
If you think about it,

947
57:07.444 --> 57:09.544
your second wife's daughter is still a daughter,

948
57:10.014 --> 57:11.414
and the father who married her mother...

949
57:11.544 --> 57:12.714
is still a father,

950
57:13.184 --> 57:14.844
so it's not a complete scam, I guess.

951
57:16.454 --> 57:17.454
A scam?

952
57:22.354 --> 57:23.554
What is it that you want?

953
57:26.924 --> 57:29.934
(Chairman Jang Hoon Tae)

954
57:31.634 --> 57:33.564
Let me borrow some business funds, in-law.

955
57:43.274 --> 57:44.674
Here is your meat.

956
57:48.584 --> 57:49.754
Enjoy your meal.

957
57:50.554 --> 57:51.954
Please let me know if you need anything.

958
57:52.014 --> 57:53.684
- Yes, thank you. - Thank you.

959
57:53.754 --> 57:55.324
- Yes. - Looks delicious.

960
58:03.564 --> 58:04.564
(Damga Charcoal Grill)

961
58:06.834 --> 58:08.164
Are you a fan of mine?

962
58:08.964 --> 58:10.134
I'm Korean.

963
58:10.434 --> 58:12.334
No, I mean, are you a fan?

964
58:13.074 --> 58:14.774
Give me your phone, I'll take a picture for you.

965
58:16.074 --> 58:17.174
I'm not a fan.

966
58:17.674 --> 58:19.414
I just need a place to hide for a second.

967
58:21.784 --> 58:23.314
Can you just stand in front of me for a bit?

968
58:27.954 --> 58:29.824
My mom is over there.

969
58:30.424 --> 58:31.624
It'd be bad if I got caught.

970
58:32.824 --> 58:33.964
Who's your mom?

971
58:36.094 --> 58:37.464
The employee with the bob cut.

972
58:45.974 --> 58:47.974
(Damga Charcoal Grill)

973
58:53.284 --> 58:54.314
Oh my.

974
58:54.484 --> 58:55.644
Gyu Seo.

975
58:56.484 --> 58:57.554
Hello.

976
59:01.824 --> 59:04.494
This is my girlfriend, and she's a bit shy.

977
59:07.324 --> 59:08.694
Did you come to eat meat?

978
59:08.794 --> 59:10.194
Why didn't you come in if you're here?

979
59:10.294 --> 59:11.964
No, I was just passing by...

980
59:12.864 --> 59:14.534
This is called yujadanja,

981
59:14.864 --> 59:17.174
and it's a rice cake that the king used to eat.

982
59:17.634 --> 59:20.144
I have a fan, and her mother made it herself.

983
59:20.204 --> 59:22.204
Why give something so precious to me?

984
59:23.144 --> 59:24.914
You should take it home to your father.

985
59:25.214 --> 59:27.414
Or eat it with your girlfriend.

986
59:28.084 --> 59:30.614
My dad and my girlfriend don't really like rice cakes.

987
59:33.554 --> 59:35.584
Thank you. I'll enjoy it then.

988
59:36.424 --> 59:38.154
I'm a bit busy right now,

989
59:38.354 --> 59:40.164
so make sure to come eat meat next time.

990
59:40.594 --> 59:42.494
Bring your girlfriend too.

991
59:43.894 --> 59:45.964
Make sure to show me your face next time.

992
59:47.934 --> 59:49.234
I'll enjoy this.

993
59:53.844 --> 59:55.204
That lady is your mom?

994
01:00:06.354 --> 01:00:07.754
Why are you hiding to look at your mom?

995
01:00:10.594 --> 01:00:12.624
What is your relationship with my mom?

996
01:00:13.094 --> 01:00:14.394
I asked first.

997
01:00:14.864 --> 01:00:16.434
I even hid you so you would not get caught.

998
01:00:18.694 --> 01:00:21.204
I am thirsty. Do you want some water?

999
01:00:22.234 --> 01:00:23.974
I asked why you are hiding and watching your mom.

1000
01:00:26.244 --> 01:00:27.244
Are you in high school?

1001
01:00:28.544 --> 01:00:29.544
Yes.

1002
01:00:30.374 --> 01:00:32.444
Why do you think I would hide to watch my mom?

1003
01:00:32.574 --> 01:00:34.384
Because I do not want to run into her.

1004
01:00:34.814 --> 01:00:36.654
Were you abandoned by your mom or something?

1005
01:00:38.414 --> 01:00:39.424
Excuse me?

1006
01:00:39.624 --> 01:00:41.984
Did your mom have an affair and abandon you or something?

1007
01:00:42.454 --> 01:00:43.454
Hey.

1008
01:00:43.524 --> 01:00:45.254
If not, why are you hiding and watching your mom?

1009
01:00:45.624 --> 01:00:46.624
She is your mom.

1010
01:00:47.024 --> 01:00:48.624
She seemed like a really nice person.

1011
01:00:50.594 --> 01:00:53.304
Who are you? How do you know my mom?

1012
01:00:53.464 --> 01:00:55.304
People would think you are her son.

1013
01:00:55.734 --> 01:00:57.604
I wish I were her son, too.

1014
01:00:58.204 --> 01:00:59.974
So I could finally be a good son to her.

1015
01:01:02.944 --> 01:01:05.344
Hey, who do you think you are? What is your name?

1016
01:01:05.414 --> 01:01:07.014
What school, grade, and class are you in?

1017
01:01:10.714 --> 01:01:12.314
(Chairman Hong Ok Seon)

1018
01:01:14.954 --> 01:01:19.194
I really do not have a single friend.

1019
01:01:20.394 --> 01:01:21.924
Now that I have erased Jang Hoon Tae from my life,

1020
01:01:22.764 --> 01:01:24.694
I do not have a single friend I can comfortably open up to.

1021
01:01:24.764 --> 01:01:25.994
Not even one.

1022
01:01:28.434 --> 01:01:30.504
Ok Seon, you have lived your life in vain.

1023
01:01:31.634 --> 01:01:33.874
You really wasted your life.

1024
01:01:38.314 --> 01:01:40.114
Your son left you,

1025
01:01:41.084 --> 01:01:43.184
and your friends left you.

1026
01:01:44.084 --> 01:01:48.484
Ok Seon, what kind of life did you even live...

1027
01:01:50.224 --> 01:01:52.894
Wait. I do have a friend I can call.

1028
01:01:54.664 --> 01:01:57.664
(Chairman Hong Ok Seon)

1029
01:02:00.334 --> 01:02:02.434
My friend, what is going on?

1030
01:02:04.604 --> 01:02:06.474
My friend.

1031
01:02:08.004 --> 01:02:09.914
Right now,

1032
01:02:10.614 --> 01:02:12.274
I am so lonely and sad.

1033
01:02:13.384 --> 01:02:14.914
What should I do at a time like this?

1034
01:02:21.924 --> 01:02:23.254
- Seok Joong. - Yes?

1035
01:02:23.254 --> 01:02:24.554
Thank you.

1036
01:02:24.694 --> 01:02:28.464
- For what? - You showed me a whole new world.

1037
01:02:28.524 --> 01:02:31.364
If you were not in my life, what would I have done?

1038
01:02:32.334 --> 01:02:33.834
I cannot tell you...

1039
01:02:33.964 --> 01:02:36.234
- how happy I am to have you, too. - Really?

1040
01:02:36.304 --> 01:02:37.904
My children treat me like spoiled food...

1041
01:02:37.974 --> 01:02:39.604
- and only mistreat me... - Yes.

1042
01:02:39.674 --> 01:02:42.244
Because of you, I realised that I am a useful person...

1043
01:02:42.504 --> 01:02:44.614
and that I am so glad to be alive.

1044
01:02:44.674 --> 01:02:46.844
- Is that so? - Thank you, Ok Seon.

1045
01:02:47.114 --> 01:02:51.184
You are welcome. Let us go.

1046
01:02:51.254 --> 01:02:55.584
- Let us run. - Let us go.

1047
01:03:11.774 --> 01:03:14.344
Please dump me today, Mu Jin.

1048
01:03:15.444 --> 01:03:17.944
I cannot think of any more crazy things to do.

1049
01:03:24.884 --> 01:03:25.884
Gyu Rim.

1050
01:03:35.664 --> 01:03:37.864
It is me. Mu Jin.

1051
01:03:45.234 --> 01:03:48.644
Do not worry, Gyu Rim. I just have to become like you.

1052
01:03:49.244 --> 01:03:52.174
We can be embarrassed together, and go crazy together.

1053
01:04:30.384 --> 01:04:31.854
(Love on the Menu)

1054
01:04:31.914 --> 01:04:35.084
No matter what you decide to do, I will not misunderstand you,

1055
01:04:35.154 --> 01:04:38.154
- and I will not run away. - Make up with your mother.

1056
01:04:38.224 --> 01:04:40.424
It seems like there is a grandson...

1057
01:04:40.494 --> 01:04:41.794
Hey, kid. If all else fails,

1058
01:04:41.794 --> 01:04:43.594
- I will take my grandson. - Me?

1059
01:04:43.664 --> 01:04:45.094
Who do you take after to be so smart?

1060
01:04:45.094 --> 01:04:46.164
A divorce?

1061
01:04:46.164 --> 01:04:47.404
Who said you could get a divorce?

1062
01:04:47.404 --> 01:04:49.134
Live with me ten more years...

1063
01:04:49.234 --> 01:04:50.674
or pay three million dollars in alimony.

1064
01:04:50.734 --> 01:04:52.374
- Crazy... - Hello.

1065
01:04:52.534 --> 01:04:53.674
Han Gyu Rim came to our house.

1066
01:04:54.271 --> 01:04:56.441
- To see Mom. - What I said before,

1067
01:04:57.114 --> 01:04:58.374
I came to take it back.
